@page "/truepace"
<PageTitle>TruePace</PageTitle>
<h1>TruePace</h1>
<p>TruePace is the original name for a goal time laid onto a course. A generated race stores that goal and, on the phone, compares your live pace with it.</p>
<p>Uphill segments cost more time than the same distance on the flat. This site shows the goal you set.</p>
